5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good evening, everyone. Let us begin this game with a calm mind.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Agreed. Since we have no information yet, we should observe each other's behavior carefully.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Rin,,I'm so excited! I'm going to find the werewolf no matter what!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Let's just try to be logical about this.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,A spirited start from Rin. I look forward to seeing how our logic unfolds.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,Does anyone have a specific strategy they would like to propose?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,Not yet. It's too early to make claims. We should wait for the Seer's first lead.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Mizuki, you sound so sure of yourself! Are you the Seer?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Misaki,,It's unlikely anyone would reveal their role this early.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. The mystery is half the fun, isn't it?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I suppose we should just get to know each other's patterns for now.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,That's the most rational approach.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Rin,,I'm just going to watch everyone's faces!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
