31,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I have some information. Mizuki, I'm afraid you are the werewolf.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"What? That's a bold lie. Jonathan, you're trying to frame me to protect yourself.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Whoa! We have a werewolf already? Jonathan, are you really the Seer?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Misaki,,This is a very direct start. It's either Jonathan is the Seer or he's the werewolf.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,How provocative. A direct accusation on day one. This certainly speeds things up.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I am the Seer. I divined Mizuki last night, and the result was clear.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,It's a classic play. The werewolf claims to be the Seer to eliminate a threat. I am a villager.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Benjamin, what do you think? You're smart!","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"If Mizuki is the werewolf, we win now. If Jonathan is lying, we lose a villager.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Logic suggests we weigh the risk. However, Jonathan's composure is quite convincing.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I have no reason to lie. If you execute me, the werewolf remains.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Benjamin, @Misaki, please think. Why would the Seer reveal themselves so instantly? It's too risky.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Rin,,But Jonathan seems so nice! I believe him!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'm leaning towards Jonathan. Mizuki's defense is a bit too aggressive.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I find myself agreeing with Misaki. The aggression can be a mask for guilt.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
